    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Royal are delighted to present this impressive three-bedroom semi-detached home, ideally located in the well-established Avondale estate, within easy walking distance of Trim town centre.\nExtensively renovated and upgraded by the current owners, the property offers bright, spacious and versatile accommodation in excellent condition throughout.\nA key feature is the transformation of the original garage, which has been replaced with a large, bright room suitable for use as a third bedroom, home office, playroom, family room or gym. The ground floor also includes an entrance hall, sitting room, impressive open-plan kitchen/dining area, generous utility room and shower room.\nUpstairs are two well-proportioned bedrooms, including the principal bedroom with ensuite, together with the main bathroom.\nThe property benefits from a B BER rating, reflecting the energy efficiency upgrades carried out and potentially allowing purchasers to avail of competitive green mortgage rates, subject to lender criteria.\nAvondale is a mature and popular residential development, conveniently located within walking distance of schools, shops, cafés, restaurants and sporting facilities.\nOffering excellent space, flexibility and a convenient location, this superb home is ready for immediate occupation. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nComposite front door, Ceiling coving, understairs storage area, tiled floor.\n\nSitting Room - \nLaminate wood flooring, ceiling coving, granite fireplace with stove insert, wall mounted curtain rail, granite fireplace surround with insert stove.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - \nWall and floor fitted kitchen units, four ring ceramic hob with granite tiled splashback and Bosch extractor fan over,Bosch double oven, Bosch under counter oven,Bosch fridge freezer unit, belfast sink with filtered water tap. Island unit with storage under and granite countertop.\n\nUtility Room - \nWall and floor mounted storage units with black countertop, tiled floor.\n\nShower Room - \nWash-hand basin with wall mounted mirror over, Triton T90 Xr electric shower, WC, tiled floor, ceiling coving.\n\nPlayroom - \nLaminate floor, fitted shelving unit.\n\nLanding - \nCarpeted stairs and landing, access to attic.\n\nHotpress - \nInsulated cylinder, four bar pump, thermostat, storage shelving.\n\nPrincipal Bedroom - \nBuilt-in wardrobe units, ceiling coving, carpeted floor, walk in wardrobe with shelving units.\n\nEn-Suite - \nTiled walls and floor, wash-hand basin with wall mounted shelf, mirror and light over, WC, PVC bath tub with mixer shower unit, taps, shower curtain and rail.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nCarpeted floor.\n\nGuest WC - \nTiled floor and walls, Wash-hand basin with wall mounted mirror and light over, WC, aqualisa mixer shower unit.\n\nRear Garden - \nMainly laid to lawn with paved/gravel patio area, water tap, electrical socket box, wooden gate at side entrance to rear, rasied planting borders, maintained hedging, wooden fencing.\n\n"
      },
      {
